<title>HUNGARY: Budapest BSE Aug spot turnover falls to 59.86 bln.</title>
<headline>Budapest BSE Aug spot turnover falls to 59.86 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total turnover on the Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE)'s spot market fell to 59.86 billion forints in August, down from 70.03 billion in July, despite a record turnover in equities, the BSE said in its monthly report.</p>
<p>TOTAL BSE TURNOVER - (in billion forints, including double</p>
<p>counting of sales and purchases)</p>
<p>	Shares  G.b.    C.b.    T-bills I.notes C.coupons  Total</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p> Aug 41.95    7.69    0.00	6.21   0.56    3.47	59.86</p>
<p>July 33.34   24.90    0.00	8.30   2.54    0.95	70.03</p>
<p>June 29.99   27.98    0.53	5.13   0.26    1.60	65.48</p>
<p> May 39.63   10.76    0.00	3.84   0.33    1.20	55.76</p>
<p> Apr 29.96   16.24    0.04	1.31   0.55    0.96	49.05</p>
<p> Mar 30.01   23.70    0.00	1.96   0.21    1.15	57.02</p>
<p> Feb 31.90   27.75    0.00	5.27   0.38    0.76	66.07</p>
<p> Jan 26.05   39.90    0.00	4.37   0.90    0.31	71.52</p>
<p>1995</p>
<p> Dec 10.31   12.40    0.00	9.97   0.80    0.26	33.74</p>
<p> Nov  6.47    2.21    0.00	4.74   0.69    0.29	14.40</p>
<p> Oct  5.03   29.07    0.00     11.17   0.17    0.40	45.84</p>
<p> Sept 8.72   15.66    0.00     10.21   0.12    0.32	35.02</p>
<p> Aug 20.29    3.09    0.04	1.14   0.14    0.22	24.92</p>
<p>NOTE:  G.b. = Government bonds</p>
<p>	 C.b. = Corporate bonds</p>
<p>	 I.notes = Investment notes</p>
<p>	 C.coupons = Compensation coupons</p>
<p>Share capitalisation fell to 577.2 billion forints at the end of July from a record 636.7 billion forints on June 28, the BSE said. -- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 266 2410</p>
